    "updated_at": "2017-08-10T17:12:02Z",
    "body": "AFAIK current browser initial about:blank handling is only compatible for this case:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<iframe src=\"foo.html\" id=\"frame\">\r\n<script>\r\ndocument.getElementById('frame').contentWindow.foo = \"foo\";\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n\r\nDeclarative iframe that is synchronously mutated.",
